{"updated":"2026-11-15T02:15:38.957Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Thunderstorms, giant hail and powerful winds forecast for NSW as wild weather hits east coast. Elsewhere, my mother told me I would die if I sought treatment for Ebola - I am proof you can survive. And judo champion shakes up French presidential race with surprise candidacy. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 3.1 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 7.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 43 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.5 near northern Mid-Atlantic Ridge. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.37,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,1,1.24,1.36,1.39,1.43,1.45,1.5,1.52,1.54,1.57,1.61,1.66,1.73,1.79,1.83,1.87,1.9,1.95,1.99,2.02,2.07,2.11,2.16,2.19,2.24,2.29,2.33,2.38,2.42,2.47,2.54,2.61,2.73,2.82,2.94,2.97,3.01,3.03,3.09,3.13,3.19,3.29,3.38,3.44,3.51,3.55,3.61,3.66,3.7,3.75,3.77,3.8,3.84,3.87,3.89,3.91,3.96,3.99,4.08,4.13,4.19,4.24,4.3,4.34,4.38,4.43,4.46,4.52,4.63,4.78,4.93,5.45,5.5,5.57,5.63,5.67,5.72,5.77,5.82,5.88,5.93,6.01,6.07,6.15,6.27,6.34,6.46,6.53,6.64,6.71,6.75,6.79,6.86,6.91,7,7.07,7.14,7.2,7.22,7.26,7.29,7.36,7.42,7.49,7.55,7.59,7.63,7.67,7.72,7.78,7.84,7.88,7.96,8.02,8.09,8.14,8.2,8.24,8.31,8.37,8.42,8.47,8.59,8.66,8.71,8.75,8.79,8.82,8.86,8.9,8.95,9.1,9.61,9.79,9.9,9.95,10.02,10.08,10.19,10.26,10.31,10.37,10.41,10.46,10.5,10.54,10.56,10.6,10.63,10.71,10.76,10.84,10.91,10.97,11.05,11.15,11.19,11.25,11.3,11.38,11.43,11.54,11.6,11.67,11.79,11.94,12.54,12.65,12.71,12.77,12.82,12.86,12.92,12.96,13.02,13.11,13.15,13.24,13.29,13.34,13.41,13